OL,3,GNEWSABikers and street vendors to face
OL,4,Atougher rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FRestrictions on the use of bikes and
OL,7,Fmobile street trading in Leeds city
OL,8,Fcentre will come into force from
OL,9,FOctober.
OL,11,FThe Briggate Action Plan is aimed at
OL,12,Fmaking some of the city centre's
OL,13,Fbusiest areas safer, with 87% of
OL,14,Frespondents to a public consultation in
OL,15,Ffavour of the proposals.
OL,17,FThey include a ban on riding bicycles
OL,18,Fand e-bikes within the city centre's
OL,19,Fpedestrianised shopping area from 10:30
OL,20,Funtil 20:00 every day, and a clampdown
OL,21,Fon mobile street trading without
OL,22,Fpermission.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
