OL,3,GNEWSABikers and street vendors to face
OL,4,Atougher rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Leeds City Council
OL,7,Fsaid: "With these new regulations in
OL,8,Fplace, our hope is that both day-to-day
OL,9,Fvisits and major events will now be
OL,10,Feven more enjoyable, successful and
OL,11,Fwelcoming."
